{% doc %}
  Authorization policy support_desk_write (pos-module-mcp spec 12.2). The
  engine resolves a tool's named policy to this fixed app path, so a module
  cannot ship its own; this delegates to the one the support module defines.

  Only principal is forwarded, because that is all the policy reads.

  Fail-closed: the engine treats a missing partial, an error, or anything
  other than an explicit allow as a denial.
  @param {object} principal - The MCP principal, { id, user_id }
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  function decision = 'modules/support/mcp/policies/support_desk_write', principal: principal
  return decision
%}
